      "text": "commandments given to servants after manner of their language, D&C 1:24. the Lord speaks in language that man may naturally understand, D&C 29:33. he whose language is meek and edifies is of God, D&C 52:16. Saints seek knowledge beyond what imperfections of language can express, D&C 67:5. every man shall hear gospel in own language, D&C 90:11. Saints to become acquainted with languages, D&C 90:15. elders using language encouraging polygamy have been reproved, OD 1.",
